    "description": "This course introduces students to the fundamental concepts and techniques of computer programming using the C++ programming language. The course covers problem solving, program design, mathematical functions, decision structures, loops, arrays, strings, and multidimensional arrays. Students will learn how to develop algorithms and implement structured programs using appropriate programming constructs. Emphasis is placed on logical reasoning, computational thinking, debugging, and writing efficient programs to solve practical problems. The course also develops foundational skills necessary for further study in software development, data science, and engineering applications."
  },
